=== Feature analysis: logreg | cheap scalars ===

Coefficients (standardized; + means higher value -> more likely to need TPT):
  vanilla_margin               -2.393
  tda_neg_cache_fill           +0.721
  vanilla_entropy              -0.581
  tda_pos_cache_mean_sim       -0.549
  tda_cache_fill               -0.436
  tda_cache_agrees_with_clip   -0.337
  tda_pos_cache_max_sim        +0.216
  vanilla_confidence           -0.107
  vanilla_text_alignment       +0.106

Baseline out-of-fold AUC (all features): 0.844
Drop-one ablation (negative delta = feature helps):
  without vanilla_entropy              AUC 0.843  (delta -0.001)
  without vanilla_confidence           AUC 0.844  (delta -0.000)
  without vanilla_margin               AUC 0.845  (delta +0.001)
  without vanilla_text_alignment       AUC 0.849  (delta +0.004)
  without tda_pos_cache_max_sim        AUC 0.848  (delta +0.003)
  without tda_pos_cache_mean_sim       AUC 0.848  (delta +0.003)
  without tda_cache_agrees_with_clip   AUC 0.845  (delta +0.001)
  without tda_cache_fill               AUC 0.848  (delta +0.003)
  without tda_neg_cache_fill           AUC 0.847  (delta +0.003)

Group ablation:
  vanilla uncertainty  alone: AUC 0.853 | all except it: AUC 0.702
  TDA cache            alone: AUC 0.702 | all except it: AUC 0.853

Permutation test (200 shuffles of needs_tpt):
  Observed AUC 0.847 | shuffled mean 0.501, 95th pct 0.589, max 0.635
  p-value: 0.0050  (smallest possible with 200 shuffles: 0.0050)

